{"id":"1791b62b90bdbbfd","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-continuity.md","title":"连续性","display":"df-continuity — 连续性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-continuity","aliases":["91-df-continuity","91-df-continuity-jump","91-df-Scott-continuity"],"display":"df-continuity — 连续性","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-monotonicity]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-continuity</span><span>91-df-continuity-jump</span><span>91-df-Scott-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuity — 连续性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-continuity-—-连续性-$\\mathrm{Cont}$\">df-continuity — 连续性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (跳跃算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> (以包含关系排序的信息算子)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\n\\mathcal D\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal D\\,(X\\cup Y\\subseteq Z)\n\\right]\n\\rightarrow\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal D\\right)\n=\\bigcup_{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal D}J(\\Gamma)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\n\\mathcal D\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal D\\,(X\\cup Y\\subseteq Z)\n\\right]\n\\rightarrow\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal D\\right)\n=\\bigcup_{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal D}J(\\Gamma)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\)</span> : 跳跃算子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>的连续性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{\\alpha &lt; \\lambda}\">\\(\\bigcup_{\\alpha &lt; \\lambda}\\)</span> : 极限序数的并</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span>：任意两个成员在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 中有共同上界</li>\n</ul>\n<p>连续性的直观：\nScott 连续性要求跳跃算子保持有向并；它不包含保持任意交的条件。</p>\n<p>连续性的重要性：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>最小固定点构造</td>\n<td>极限阶段的处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大固定点构造</td>\n<td>极限阶段的处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代收敛</td>\n<td>保证极限阶段正确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>连续性与单调性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(J) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Mon}(J)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cont}(J) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Mon}(J)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>连续性蕴含单调性（在合适条件下）。</p>\n<p>连续性在迭代构造中的作用：\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 对给定链连续，才可把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 与该链的并交换。超穷迭代在极限阶段定义并集本身并不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 连续。</p>\n<p>强Kleene跳跃的连续性：\n含量词的强 Kleene 跳跃不能无条件宣称为 Scott 连续：全称句在极限处变真可能依赖无限多个实例。某些有限或命题片段可具有相应连续性。</p>\n<p>具体跳跃是否连续须依据其语言、量词和极限规则证明；“强 Kleene 连续、超赋值不连续”不是该抽象定义的一部分。</p>\n<p>连续性的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保证迭代构造在极限阶段正确</li>\n<li>提供固定点构造的理论保证</li>\n<li>区分不同跳跃算子的性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-continuity-—-连续性-$\\mathrm{Cont}$","text":"df-continuity — 连续性 $\\mathrm{Cont}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\n\\mathcal D\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal D\\,(X\\cup Y\\subseteq Z)\n\\right]\n\\rightarrow\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal D\\right)\n=\\bigcup_{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal D}J(\\Gamma)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{\\alpha < \\lambda}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}(J) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Mon}(J)","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":2271,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-continuity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91